# Source panes share one Find/Replace controller, independent of application code.
import source_search_edits.dl
import key_bindings.dl

to [focus UI search field labeled] {C string:label} [in] {a pointer to UI source editor:editor} [in] {a pointer to UI view:view}:
    set node to the UI search control labeled label in editor
    set layout to the UI layout for element node in (view's layout)
    activate UI layout layout in view
    if view's text focus != node:
        return nothing
    set view's selection's anchor to 0
    set view's selection's caret to (the UI value for node in (view's instance))'s text's length
    set view's damaged to true

to [close UI source search in] {a pointer to UI source editor:editor} [in] {a pointer to UI view:view}:
    set editor's search's visible to false
    hide UI search controls within (editor's pane) in view
    unbind UI key 256 with modifiers 0 from (editor's pane) in (view's instance)
    clear UI source search marks in editor
    restore UI source location (editor's current) in editor in view
    invalidate view's instance

to [show UI source search in] {a pointer to UI source editor:editor} [replacing] {boolean:replacing} [focusing query] {boolean:focus} [in] {a pointer to UI view:view}:
    remember the UI source location of editor in view
    set search to the address of (editor's search)
    if search's visible = false:
        set first to the minimum of (editor's current's anchor) and (editor's current's caret)
        set last to the maximum of (editor's current's anchor) and (editor's current's caret)
        if last > first:
            set UI search text labeled "Find text" in editor to (the substring of (editor's document's source) from first spanning (last - first) bytes)
    set search's visible to true
    set search's replacing to replacing
    set search's generation to -1
    set search's error to ""
    set (the UI value for (the UI search control labeled "Search tools" in editor) in (view's instance))'s number to 1
    set (the UI value for (the UI search control labeled "Replace tools" in editor) in (view's instance))'s number to (1 if replacing, else 0)
    bind UI key 256 with modifiers 0 from (editor's pane) in (view's instance) to (the function named "close UI search from key $") with context (editor as a pointer)
    invalidate view's instance
    refresh UI source search in editor in view
    if focus:
        focus UI search field labeled "Find text" in editor in view

to [open UI search from key] {a pointer to UI view:view}:
    set editor to view's instance's event context as a pointer to UI source editor
    show UI source search in editor replacing false focusing query true in view

to [open UI replacement from key] {a pointer to UI view:view}:
    set editor to view's instance's event context as a pointer to UI source editor
    show UI source search in editor replacing true focusing query false in view
    if the UI element (the UI search control labeled "Replace text" in editor) is enabled in (view's instance):
        focus UI search field labeled "Replace text" in editor in view
    else:
        focus UI search field labeled "Find text" in editor in view

to [replace UI search from key] {a pointer to UI view:view}:
    set editor to view's instance's event context as a pointer to UI source editor
    ignore replace UI source search in editor all ((view's modifiers bitwise and 4) != 0) in view

to [close UI search from key] {a pointer to UI view:view}:
    close UI source search in (view's instance's event context as a pointer to UI source editor) in view

to [advance UI search from key] {a pointer to UI view:view}:
    set editor to view's instance's event context as a pointer to UI source editor
    if editor's search's visible = false:
        show UI source search in editor replacing false focusing query false in view
    move UI source search in editor forward ((view's modifiers bitwise and 1) = 0) in view

to [read UI source search field] {a pointer to UI instance:instance}:
    set editor to instance's event context as a pointer to UI source editor
    refresh UI source search in editor in (editor's workspace's tools's view)

to [activate UI source search action] {a pointer to UI instance:instance}:
    set editor to instance's event context as a pointer to UI source editor
    set view to editor's workspace's tools's view
    set label to instance's event target's text
    if label = "Find":
        show UI source search in editor replacing false focusing query true in view
    else if label = "Replace…":
        show UI source search in editor replacing true focusing query false in view
        focus UI search field labeled "Replace text" in editor in view
    else if label = "Close find":
        close UI source search in editor in view
    else if (label = "Previous match") or (label = "Next match"):
        move UI source search in editor forward (label = "Next match") in view
    else:
        ignore replace UI source search in editor all (label = "Replace all") in view

to [bind UI source search controls in] {a pointer to UI source editor:editor}:
    set window to editor's workspace's instance
    set context to editor as a pointer
    for each label in ["Find", "Replace…", "Close find", "Next match", "Previous match", "Replace", "Replace all"]:
        bind (the UI search control labeled label in editor) in window to (the function named "activate UI source search action $") for event 0 with context context
    for each label in ["Find text", "Replace text", "Match case", "Whole words"]:
        bind (the UI search control labeled label in editor) in window to (the function named "read UI source search field $") for event 0 with context context
    for each modifiers in [2, 8]:
        bind UI key 70 with modifiers modifiers from (editor's pane) in window to (the function named "open UI search from key $") with context context
        bind UI key 72 with modifiers modifiers from (editor's pane) in window to (the function named "open UI replacement from key $") with context context
    for each modifiers in [0, 1]:
        bind UI key 292 with modifiers modifiers from (editor's pane) in window to (the function named "advance UI search from key $") with context context
        bind UI key 257 with modifiers modifiers from (the UI search control labeled "Find text" in editor) in window to (the function named "advance UI search from key $") with context context
    for each modifiers in [0, 2, 6, 8, 12]:
        bind UI key 257 with modifiers modifiers from (the UI search control labeled "Replace text" in editor) in window to (the function named "replace UI search from key $") with context context
